 ],
 "synopsis": "Quant Mutual Fund sold a total of 20.81 lakh shares of Jubilant Pharmova in bulk deals, valued at approximately Rs 190.47 crore. On the buying side, Abakkus Four2Eight Opportunities Fund purchased 11 lakh shares of Jubilant Pharmova at Rs 915 apiece, valuing that portion of the transaction at Rs 100.65 crore. The transactions occurred as the pharmaceutical company announced plans to raise up to Rs 800 crore through non-convertible debentures and seek broader debt issuance authorisation. The sales by Quant Mutual Fund reduced its previously held stake of 1.85% in Jubilant Pharmova.",
